OL,3,GNEWSANew school plan mothballed over
OL,4,Apupil number fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a new primary school
OL,7,Fhave been put on hold over fears there
OL,8,Fwould not be enough pupils to fill it.
OL,10,FLancashire County Council said it had
OL,11,Fpaused indefinitely the development of
OL,12,Fthe 420-child school off Whittingham
OL,13,FLane in Whittingham, on the outskirts
OL,14,Fof Preston.
OL,16,FWhile the decision to mothball the
OL,17,Fplans will be reviewed in May, the
OL,18,Flocal authority said it believed the
OL,19,Fprojected shortfall in demand would
OL,20,Fmake the school unsustainable.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
